          "lastBuildDate": "2024-06-04T09:57:16.438Z",
          "description": "Get ready to hear your favorite stories remixed with beats and hooks that you can’t find in books!   In Once Upon a Beat, host DJ Fyütch and his sidekick/turntable Baby Scratch drop the needle on classic stories, spinning them up with a hip-hop twist. They’re turning the tables on your favorite fables – putting the Rap in Rapunzel, letting Goldilocks rock out, and helping the Ugly Duckling march to his own beat! Where hip hop and fables meet, It's Once Upon a Beat!\n\nThis podcast contains ads. Yoto does not control these ads and they do not represent us or our opinions. Please listen with care.",
